    text: "Change\r\nSuspension of seasonal tripper service with minor changes to weekday, Saturday and Sunday/Holiday schedules.\r\n\nReason\r\nAligns with seasonal ridership levels and improves on-time perfomance.\r\n\nSurvey Results\r\nOut of 30 respondents, 33% reported a positive impact from the change, 37% indicated it had no impact, and 30% perceived the change negatively."
